# The Weatherspoon War (adoulin, call-only): a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin, the quest accepted (a GM: nothing
# begins it). Flapano has no default. Weatherspoon_War_Status 5 (a GM): its arm fails: Exotic Delicacies' offer (2860,
# Flapano_Odd_Even 1), finished on 0. Status 6 (a GM: nothing sets it): 191 first (no finish), the Exotic var not
# touched; again 191. Status 7: Exotic's turn: the shop (the var 0). Completed at status 6 (a GM): the offer 2860 (the
# var 1). Available at status 6 (a GM): the shop (the var 0).
lists WesternAdoulin/Flapano/onTrigger
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=71.5,0,-13.5 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Adoulin.TheWeatherspoonWar accepted
charvar Weatherspoon_War_Status 5
login
trigger Flapano                         # status 5: Exotic Delicacies' 2860 (the var 1)
finish option=0
charvar Weatherspoon_War_Status 6       # a GM
trigger Flapano                         # status 6: 191
finish                                  # no finish arm
trigger Flapano                         # 191 again (the Exotic var stays 1)
finish
charvar Weatherspoon_War_Status 7       # a GM
trigger Flapano                         # status 7: Exotic's turn: the shop (the var 0)
charvar Weatherspoon_War_Status 6       # a GM
quest Adoulin.TheWeatherspoonWar completed   # a GM
trigger Flapano                         # completed at 6: Exotic's 2860 (the var 1)
finish option=0
quest Adoulin.TheWeatherspoonWar available   # a GM
trigger Flapano                         # available at 6: the shop (the var 0)
